Z||000004||loafer87gt||01-13-2001||07:35 PM||||Oh yeah, ping is how long a computer takes to respond to you. The lower the ping, the better connection = faster downloads. By the way, I just found a really cool program that I have been using instead of Napster. Its called Bearshare, and lets you grab pics, movies, and Mp3 files. Its really easy to setup, and you can download it from <A HREF="http://www.bearshare.com" TARGET=_blank>www.bearshare.com</A>  <BR>||||reg||1
